Z||000029||Songman||06-27-2001||12:15 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pontiaddict:<BR><B>Pontiac 421 V8<BR>If I could only find one and afford to own it.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Oh yeah! Nice one!<P>I actually had a bowtie 409 one time.. Factory chrome valve covers and all. I was 16 at the time. Got it from a buddy of mine for $75 and made a tidy profit on it years later. Could have made a lot more now though.<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
