Z||000042||Black88GT||06-27-2001||09:09 PM||||For American cars I would say the motor used in the ZR1 Vette, LT4.  GM finally gets with the program and uses DOHC.<P>For foreign cars, I would say the motor in the Ferrari 360 zmodena, gobs of displacement/torque and high revving capabilities, the best of both worlds, only problem is reliability.<P>Also, whats wrong with the 3400?  It's got roller rockers, roller cam, huge intake ports, 4 bolt main, its a nice motor.||||reg||1
